<title>SINGAPORE: Hitachi Zosen full year net up 13.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Zosen full year net up 13.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 7.17   vs   6.30</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)    2.05   vs   1.80</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	 1.00   vs   1.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		 188.27   vs 224.93</p>
<p>    Other income	     2.89   vs   1.99</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 0.48   vs   0.61</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amort     6.14   vs   5.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  10.65   vs   8.85</p>
<p>    Income from associates 0.53   vs   0.66</p>
<p>    Tax			  3.58   vs   2.87</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)	0.42   vs   0.34</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain     0.06   vs   0.53</p>
<p>Div register/pay - Sept 20 /Oct 15 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name Hitachi Zosen Singapore Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
